### 模块级配置 v2 — 需要模块身份
### Authorization: Bearer <moduleToken> 或 X-Module-Token
### Query 必须带 moduleId；configKey 须与该模块 manifest.configKey 一致

### 读整份 configs/<configKey>.json
# @name moduleConfigGet
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/configs/{{configKey}}?moduleId={{moduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moduleToken}}

### 写单个 key（读-改-写文件）
# @name moduleConfigSet
POST {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/configs/{{configKey}}/set?moduleId={{moduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moduleToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "key": "exampleKey",
  "value": "exampleValue"
}

### SSE：配置变更推送（REST Client 会保持连接）
# @name moduleConfigNotify
GET {{dbBase}}/api/sfmc/configs/{{configKey}}/notify?moduleId={{moduleId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{moduleToken}}
Accept: text/event-stream
